msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Nich begäng"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:298
msgid "Current Activity, Threaded"
msgstr "Aktuell Aktiviteet mit Klöönsnacks"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:299
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups with the most recent group displayed "
"on top. Messages are threaded and the most recent is displayed again on top. "
"The group for a thread is selected by the most recent message in it. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all "
"the threads that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt plietsch Datumrebeet-Koppeln, mit den niegsten Koppel "
"baven. Narichten warrt as Klöönsnacks wiest, wedder de niegste baven. En "
"Klöönsnack sien Koppel warrt mit de niegste Naricht dor binnen utsöcht. "
"Binnen \"Vundaag\" deist Du also all nieg Narichten finnen, un ok all "
"Klöönsnacks, binnen de sik vundaag wat daan hett."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:320
msgid "Current Activity, Flat"
msgstr "Aktuell Aktiviteet, flach"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:321
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups with the most recent group displayed "
"on top. Messages are not threaded and the most recent message is displayed "
"on top. So for example, in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages "
"arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt plietsch Datumrebeet-Koppeln, mit den niegsten Koppel "
"baven. Narichten warrt nich as Klöönsnacks wiest, de niegste steiht wedder "
"baven. Binnen \"Vundaag\" deist Du also all Narichten finnen, de vundaag "
"ankamen sünd."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:340
msgid "Activity by Date, Threaded"
msgstr "Aktiviteet na Datum, mit Klöönsnacks"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:341
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups with the most recent group displayed on "
"top. Messages are threaded and the most recent is displayed again on top. "
"The group for a thread is selected by the most recent message in it. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all "
"the threads that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt Enkeldag-Koppeln, mit den niegsten Koppel baven. "
"Narichten warrt as Klöönsnacks wiest, wedder de niegste baven. En Klöönsnack "
"sien Koppel warrt mit de niegste Naricht dor binnen utsöcht. Binnen \"Vundaag"
"\" deist Du also all nieg Narichten finnen, un ok all Klöönsnacks, binnen de "
"sik vundaag wat daan hett."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:362
msgid "Activity by Date, Flat"
msgstr "Aktiviteet na Datum, flach"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:363
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups with the most recent group displayed on "
"top. Messages are not threaded and the most recent message is displayed on "
"top. So for example, in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages "
"arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht bruukt Enkeldag-Koppeln, mit den niegsten Koppel baven. "
"Narichten warrt nich as Klöönsnacks wiest, de niegste steiht wedder baven. "
"Binnen \"Vundaag\" deist Du also all nieg Narichten finnen, de vundaag "
"ankamen sünd."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:382
msgid "Standard Mailing List"
msgstr "Normaal Nettpostlist"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:383
msgid ""
"This is a plain and old mailing list view: no groups, heavy threading and "
"messages displayed with the most recent on bottom"
msgstr ""
"Dat is en eenfach, oolt Narichtenlist-Ansicht: keen Koppeln, vele "
"Klöönsnacks un de niegste Naricht steiht nerrn."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:401
msgid "Flat Date View"
msgstr "Flach Datumansicht"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:402
msgid ""
"This is a plain and old list of messages sorted by date: no groups, no "
"threading and messages displayed with the most recent on top by default"
msgstr ""
"Dat is en eenfach, oolt Narichtenlist-Ansicht: keen Koppeln, keen "
"Klöönsnacks un de niegste Naricht steiht standardwies baven."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:420
msgid "Senders/Receivers, Flat"
msgstr "Senner u. Adressaten, flach"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:421
msgid ""
"This view groups the messages by senders or receivers (depending on the "
"folder type). Groups are sorted by the sender/receiver name or e-mail. "
"Messages are not threaded and the most recent message is displayed on bottom."
msgstr ""
"Disse Anischt koppelt de Narichten na Senners oder Adressaten tosamen (hangt "
"vun den Ornertyp af). Koppeln warrt na de Naams oder Nettpostadressen "
"sorteert. Dat gifft keen Klöönsnacks un de niegste Naricht steiht nerrn."

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:440
msgid "Thread Starters"
msgstr "Klöönsnackanfäng"

#: messagelistview/core/manager.cpp:441
msgid ""
"This view groups the messages in threads and then groups the threads by the "
"starting user. Groups are sorted by the user name or e-mail. "
msgstr ""
"Disse Ansicht koppelt de Narichten as Klöönsnacks tosamen, un de warrt "
"wedder na de Naams oder Nettpostadressen vun de Brukers tohoopstellt, de mit "
"de Klöönsnacks anfungen hebbt."

